# Eye on Methane – UNEP International Methane Emissions Observatory (IMEO) Data Platform

**Theme:** Climate / Methane Emissions / Environmental Monitoring / Energy / Geospatial  
**Coverage:** Global; point-source detections across 63+ countries; all major methane-emitting sectors (oil & gas, coal, waste, agriculture, steel & metallurgical coal)  
