## Map Layers

| Layer | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| **Satellite Detection Heatmap** | Global density map of persistent methane flux (kg CH₄/h); color-coded from low to high emission rate |
| **Point Source and Plume** | Individual emission events mapped by location; color-coded by ΔCH₄ concentration (ppm) |
| **Science Studies** | IMEO-commissioned measurement study locations |
| **Mitigation Stories** | Case studies where MARS notifications led to documented mitigation action |
| **Oil & Gas Sector** | Facility-level assets classified by OGMP 2.0 reporting tier (Gold Standard, Gold Standard Pathway, No Gold Standard, Non-Operated, Disclosed) |
| **Steel & Met Coal Sector** | Mines (open and closed), steel plants, and ports; beta methane data from metallurgical coal supply chains |

---

## Sectors Covered

- **Oil & Gas:** Production, processing, transport, and distribution assets globally
- **Thermal Coal:** Mine venting shafts and surface facilities
- **Metallurgical (Met) Coal:** Open and closed mines, coal transport, steel plant emissions (Steel Methane Programme — SMP)
- **Waste:** Landfills (major source in top 50 emitters list)
- **Agriculture:** Rice cultivation, livestock (via science studies; expanding coverage)

