## Key Variables per Emission Record

| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| Country | Country of emission source |
| Sector | Oil & gas, waste, coal, agriculture, etc. |
| Potential Source Type | Landfill, flare, venting shaft, abandoned well, coal mine facility, production offshore, etc. |
| Source ID | Unique facility or event identifier (e.g., TKM_S_047) |
| Coordinates | Latitude/longitude of the emission source |
| Emission Rate | Estimated kg CH₄/h (persistency flux) |
| ΔCH₄ ppm | Methane concentration enhancement above background |
| Notification Status | Whether government/company was notified (Y/N) |
| Feedback Received | Whether a response was received |
| Estimated Emissions | Quantified CH₄ tonnes |

