## How to Access

1. **Map interface:** https://methanedata.unep.org/map — explore all layers globally; toggle between "Eye On Oil & Gas" and "Eye On All Sectors" views; click any point for full metadata
2. **Data download:** Use the download button (bottom-left of the map) to export filtered selections as CSV, Excel, or GeoJSON
3. **API:** Access via API documentation linked in the menu under "Access the Data → API Documentation"
4. **Country views:** Use the "Eye On" country selector (top-left) to filter the map and statistics to a specific country
5. **Top 50 Emitters list:** Accessible on first map load or via the layers panel — provides ranked list with source ID, country, sector, source type, coordinates, and notification status
6. **Documentation:** Approach & Methodology, MARS explainer, and sector-specific methodologies available via the hamburger menu

